{
  "semantics": {
    "attributes": {
      "final": {},
      "header": {}
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can create a redirect from an old page to a new page using Antora’s built-in "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute. This "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page attribute"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "page-attributes.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is useful when you delete a page, rename a page’s file, or move a page to a different module or component. Using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute, a page can claim the identity of one or more other pages. Antora will then redirect the URLs for those pages to the page in which the aliases are defined."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Page aliases are designed to address page renames or moves, "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "particularly within a component version"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". They are "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "not"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " a general-purpose URL router. Although they can be used to create redirects across components or component versions, you need to use this feature with care or else it can become quite noisy and thus confusing."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you remove a large number of pages, such as if you remove or rename a component or component version, and you want to preserve the existing URLs, you should not attempt to do so using page aliases. Page aliases were not designed to provide bulk URL redirects. Instead, we strongly recommended that you use the router provided by your web server or host when you remove or rename a component or component version. You can do so either using a separate step during publishing or by using an Antora extension."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "page-aliases-and-bulk-url-redirects",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Page aliases and bulk URL redirects"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute is set in the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page header"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "standard-page.html#page-header"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " of a target page using an "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "attribute entry"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "define-and-modify-attributes.html#attribute-entry"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". "
              },
              {
                "id": "target-page",
                "kind": "anchor"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "target page"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": [
                  "term"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " refers to the page you’re redirecting a source page to. "
              },
              {
                "id": "source-page",
                "kind": "anchor"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "source page"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": [
                  "term"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " refers to the deleted, renamed, or moved page that you’re redirecting from (i.e., the page to claim). A source page’s resource ID—​its "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "resource ID"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "resource-id.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " before it was deleted, renamed, or moved—​is assigned to the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute in a target page. Multiple resource IDs can be assigned to the attribute in a comma-separated list."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Title of Target Page\n:page-aliases: source-page-filename.adoc, version@component:module:source-page-filename.adoc"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Header of target page"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can split this list across multiple lines using a line continuation (a space followed by a backslash at the end of the line):"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Title of Target Page\n:page-aliases: source-page-filename.adoc, \\\nversion@component:module:source-page-filename.adoc"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Page aliases split across multiple lines"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Antora calculates the URL for a source page’s resource ID and generates redirect information so that the source page URL redirects to the target page URL. Any coordinates, such as "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "version or component"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "resource-id-coordinates.html#id-version"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", that aren’t specified in a resource ID assigned to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " are interpolated from the target page’s coordinates. The generated output format of the redirect information is determined by your chosen "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "redirect facility"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "playbook:urls-redirect-facility.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "A resource ID assigned to a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute can be used in an xref. Therefore, if you delete, rename, or move a page, you don’t need to update any references to it in your source files."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "page-aliases"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " attribute can only be applied to pages. Partials, examples, images, and attachments can’t be aliased. While a resource ID assigned to "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "page-aliases"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " works in xrefs, the "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "page version selector"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "navigation:index.html#page-dropdown"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " in the reference UI does not connect previous versions of the source page to the target page."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "page-alias-restrictions",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Page alias restrictions"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "page-aliases-attribute",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "page-aliases attribute"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you change a source page’s filename from "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "old-name.adoc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "new-name.adoc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", assign the file’s former resource ID to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " in its header."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Title of Target Page\n:page-aliases: old-name.adoc"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "new-name.adoc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "This will result in "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://base-url.com/component/version/module/old-name.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " being redirected to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://base-url.com/component/version/module/new-name.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". The version, component, and module coordinates that weren’t specified in the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "old-name.adoc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " resource ID are interpolated from the target page’s coordinates. Alternatively, if you assigned "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "indexify"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "playbook:urls-html-extension-style.html#indexify-style"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "html-extension-style"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " key in your playbook, "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://base-url.com/component/version/module/old-name/"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " will redirect to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://base-url.com/component/version/module/new-name/"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " ."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "create-a-redirect-for-a-renamed-page",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Create a redirect for a renamed page"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When a page is moved from one module to another module in the same component, the aliased resource ID needs to contain the source page’s former "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "module coordinate"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "resource-id-coordinates.html#id-module"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". In "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Example 4"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#ex-module"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", the page "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "source-1.adoc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " has moved from "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "module-1"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "module-z"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". Both "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "module-1"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " and "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "module-z"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " are modules in version "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "5.0"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " of "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "component-1"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-module",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Title of Target Page\n:page-aliases: module-1:source-1.adoc "
              },
              {
                "guard": null,
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO1-1",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "1",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "source-1.adoc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "colist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO1-1"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Specify the former module coordinate in addition to the file coordinate when moving a page to another module."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": "arabic",
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Now, Antora will redirect the URL "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://base-url.com/component-1/5.0/module-1/source-1.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to the URL "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://base-url.com/component-1/5.0/module-z/source-1.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
