        "context": "section",
        "id": "create-a-redirect-for-a-moved-page",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Create a redirect for a moved page"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Sometimes you just need to delete a page. Before redirecting the deleted page’s URL to another page, consider the following:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Is there a potential target page that would help the visitors who previously used the information on the deleted page? For instance, the deleted page described feature A, but feature A has been deprecated; users of feature A should now migrate to feature B."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Is the deleted page a high traffic page? If so, is there a relevant page that would definitely assist the people looking for the deleted page?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You shouldn’t create a redirect to a target page that doesn’t have much in common with the deleted page, as this often frustrates visitors."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If it’s appropriate to redirect the deleted page’s URL to another page, assign the deleted page’s ID to the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page-aliases"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute, making sure to specify the necessary coordinates."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-deleted",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Title of Target Page\n:page-aliases: source-page-filename.adoc"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Target page"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "admonition",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "It creates a bad user experience (and is a bad SEO practice), to redirect deleted pages to the site’s home page or a project’s start page. This policy confuses visitors because they may not realize the page they’re looking for no longer exists. In cases where there isn’t a highly relevant target page to redirect the deleted page to, it’s better to direct visitors to a custom 404 page."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "tip"
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "create-a-redirect-for-a-deleted-page",
        "level": 1,
